class ScenarioData
{
	author="Alex32";
	overviewText="Alpha 1-1 is sent to Pecher to locate and rescue the missing Alpha 1-2 crew after reports of a massive unidentified biological threat." \n "" \n "With no further contact and time running out, your squad must investigate the crash site, eliminate the hostile creature, and exfiltrate." \n " " \n "Russian ammunition and an abandoned tactical nuclear launch vehicle may provide the firepower needed to bring the threat down.";
	disabledAI=1;
};
